    <tr><td>2026-01-10</td><td>Date of alleged incident/event</td></tr>
    <tr><td>2026-01-15</td><td>FIR No. 001/2026 registered at PS GOLDEN_PS</td></tr>
    <tr><td>___________</td><td>Date of arrest / apprehension</td></tr>
    <tr><td>10 May 2026</td><td>Filing of the present application/petition</td></tr>
    <tr><td colspan="2"><em>[Advocate to add further dates as appropriate before filing.]</em></td></tr>
  </table>
  <div class="disclaimer">AI-assisted draft &mdash; verify before filing. Lawie does not provide legal advice.</div>
</div>

<div class="page-break">
  <div class="annexure-label">ANNEXURE D</div>
  <h2>Index of Documents Annexed</h2>
  <br>
  <table>
    <tr><th style="width:8%">Sr.</th><th>Document</th><th style="width:32%">Reference / Page No.</th></tr>
    <tr><td>1.</td><td>Memo of Parties</td><td>Annexure A</td></tr>
    <tr><td>2.</td><td>Synopsis</td><td>Annexure B</td></tr>
    <tr><td>3.</td><td>List of Dates and Chronology</td><td>Annexure C</td></tr>
    <tr><td>4.</td><td>Index of Documents Annexed</td><td>Annexure D (this document)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>5.</td><td>Vakalatnama</td><td>Annexure E</td></tr>
    <tr><td>6.</td><td>Court Fee Paid Statement</td><td>Annexure F</td></tr>
    <tr><td>7.</td><td>Affidavit of GOLDEN_APPLICANT</td><td>Annexure G</td></tr>
    <tr><td>8.</td><td>Copy of FIR No. 001/2026</td><td>Annexure H (to be annexed by advocate)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>9.</td><td>Identity and Address Proof of Applicant/Petitioner</td><td>Annexure I (to be annexed by advocate)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>10.</td><td>Any other document relied upon</td><td>Annexure J onwards (as applicable)</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p style="margin-top:1em"><em>Note: Page numbers to be filled in by advocate before filing.</em></p>
  <div class="disclaimer">AI-assisted draft &mdash; verify before filing. Lawie does not provide legal advice.</div>
</div>

<div class="page-break">
  <div class="annexure-label">ANNEXURE E</div>
  <h2>Vakalatnama</h2>
  <p style="text-align:center">IN THE HIGH COURT OF JUDICATURE AT ALLAHABAD</p>
  <br>
  <p>Know all men by these presents that I/We, <strong>GOLDEN_APPLICANT</strong>, resident of GOLDEN_ADDRESS, RANCHI, do hereby appoint and retain <strong>GOLDEN_ADV</strong>, Advocate, enrolled with the Bar Council (Enrolment No. <strong>GOLDEN-ENR-001</strong>), to act, appear and plead on my/our behalf in the above matter and in all proceedings arising therefrom.</p>
  <br>
  <p>I/We authorise the said Advocate to:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>File pleadings, applications, affidavits, and other documents on my/our behalf;</li>
    <li>Appear before this Hon'ble Court and all subordinate/connected courts and authorities;</li>
    <li>Accept notices and orders on my/our behalf;</li>
