  <p style="text-align:center">IN THE HIGH COURT OF JUDICATURE AT ALLAHABAD</p>
  <br>
  <p style="text-align:center"><strong>AFFIDAVIT OF GOLDEN_APPLICANT</strong></p>
  <br>
  <p>I, <strong>GOLDEN_APPLICANT</strong>, aged about 30 years, GOLDEN_FATHER, resident of GOLDEN_ADDRESS, RANCHI, do hereby solemnly affirm and state on oath as under:</p>
