  <p style="text-align:center">IN THE COURT OF DISTRICT &amp; SESSIONS JUDGE</p>
  <br>
  <p>Know all men by these presents that I/We, <strong>GOLDEN_APPLICANT</strong>, resident of GOLDEN_ADDRESS, RANCHI, do hereby appoint and retain <strong>GOLDEN_ADV</strong>, Advocate, enrolled with the Bar Council (Enrolment No. <strong>GOLDEN-ENR-001</strong>), to act, appear and plead on my/our behalf in the above matter and in all proceedings arising therefrom.</p>
  <br>
  <p>I/We authorise the said Advocate to:</p>
  <ol>
